{"4969740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Not Yet Dawn", "steam_appid": 4969740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/3ac1d6dfeba7b486ee7fe71783143511.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span>Play as young vampire Dawn as she battles her way home after a late night out! Chat with friends, argue with your sister, and drink copious amounts of items becoming stronger on your trek back to bed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/2b292267fcfe8db99db0d6d1f21508c8.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/03e405fb1b017cf23d5eb2a66bbe9adf.avif?t=1785783159\" alt=\"Dawn on fire and in pain.\" width=800 height=246 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drain health from enemies to steal back what the sun takes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sunlit gardens, dingy dungeons, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/b6034cefc61fa781bfbcd98b60b025e1.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/e342402851a60b43db86a025d6aeeb2e.avif?t=1785783159\" alt=\"Dawn running away from an enemy.\" width=800 height=246 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight three different bosses and dozens of enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time attacks and dash through enemies to deal massive damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/2b292267fcfe8db99db0d6d1f21508c8.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/4df3da866ad5c9e64cdb71a27d0dd087.avif?t=1785783159\" alt=\"Dawn and her bats looking happy and holding onto many items.\" width=800 height=246 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield dozens of weapons, in hundreds of combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink items or imbue your weapons to become stronger!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/3ac1d6dfeba7b486ee7fe71783143511.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/3ac1d6dfeba7b486ee7fe71783143511.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span>Play as young vampire Dawn as she battles her way home after a late night out! Chat with friends, argue with your sister, and drink copious amounts of items becoming stronger on your trek back to bed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4969740/extras/2b292267fcfe8db99db0d6d1f21508c8.webp?t=1785783159\" alt=\"\"width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img